WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.279 --> 00:00:03.034
- [Host] Bicycles are
changing peoples lives

00:00:03.034 --> 00:00:05.879
in San Andrés Itzapa, Guatemala.

00:00:05.879 --> 00:00:10.046
- [Mario] (speaking in foreign language)

00:00:23.051 --> 00:00:26.718
(uplifting symphonic music)

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:30.199
- [Host] This is Mario.

00:00:30.199 --> 00:00:31.427
- [Mario] (speaking in foreign language)

00:00:31.427 --> 00:00:33.641
- [Host] And he works
here, for Maya Pedal,

00:00:33.641 --> 00:00:35.545
an NGO that transforms old bicycles into

00:00:35.545 --> 00:00:38.894
cheap, eco-friendly machines
powered by pedaling.

00:00:38.894 --> 00:00:43.061
- [Mario] (speaking in foreign language)

00:00:49.588 --> 00:00:51.161
- [Host] Marta is the
owner of one of these

00:00:51.161 --> 00:00:53.117
machines, and earns a
living making tortillas.

00:00:53.117 --> 00:00:56.634
- (speaking in foreign language)

00:00:56.634 --> 00:00:58.883
- [Host] The first step
is to de-kernel the corn,

00:00:58.883 --> 00:01:00.680
which she used to do by hand.

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:04.847
- [Marta] (speaking in foreign language)

00:01:09.529 --> 00:01:13.196
(uplifing symphonic music)

00:01:44.825 --> 00:01:48.908
- (speaking in foreign language)

00:02:07.328 --> 00:02:11.411
- (speaking in foreign language)

00:02:17.471 --> 00:02:21.138
(uplifting symphonic music)

00:02:23.234 --> 00:02:26.067
(digital dinging)

